legend [shape=plaintext, fontsize=13, label="LEGEND: time runs downward; numbers give the interaction order. Solid arrow = request; green dashed arrow = response.\nVertical dotted line = participant lifeline. Blue = application/component; green = data store; grey = external system.\nAll components belong to Board API; participants reuse views 02/03. tx = one ReservationTransaction supplied by Board Repository.\nThe storage transaction ends at step 21. The mail attempt at step 24 is outside it. HTTPS/JSON are assumed external contracts.", pos="1320,-5!"];
